"type":"number"},{"type":"boolean"}]},"reason":{"type":"string"}},"required":["requested","used","reason"],"additionalProperties":false}},"avatar_auto_picked":{"description":"Set when the server auto-picked an avatar because product_ids were passed without avatars/avatar_ids (Marketing Studio video).","type":"object","properties":{"id":{"type":"string"},"name":{"type":"string"},"type":{"type":"string","enum":["preset","custom"]}},"required":["id","type"],"additionalProperties":false},"next_step":{"description":"Suggested follow-up tool call (e.g. show_marketing_studio fetch) attached to some marketing error results.","type":"object","properties":{"tool":{"type":"string"},"params":{"type":"object","propertyNames":{"type":"string"},"additionalProperties":{}}},"required":["tool","params"],"additionalProperties":false},"unlim_choice":{"description":"NO JOB WAS SUBMITTED. The caller has free unlimited generations that cover this model, and nobody has said whether to spend them. Ask the user, then call the same tool again with use_unlim: true (free) or use_unlim: false (credits). Do not pick for them.","type":"object","properties":{"message":{"type":"string","description":"The question to put to the user, verbatim."},"model":{"type":"string","description":"Model the choice applies to."},"remaining":{"description":"Unlimited generations left; null means unmetered.","anyOf":[{"type":"number"},{"type":"null"}]},"expires_at":{"description":"ISO timestamp when the allowance lapses.","anyOf":[{"type":"string"},{"type":"null"}]}},"required":["message","model"],"additionalProperties":false},"brand_kit_status":{"description":"Live brand kit status when a generation was rejected because the kit is not ready yet.","type":"string"},"cost":{"description":"Populated only when the tool was called with get_cost: true. No job was submitted.","type":"object","properties":{"credits":{"type":"number","description":"Whole-credit cost (max(1, exact // 1) when exact > 0)."},"credits_exact":{"type":"number","description":"Exact credit cost as a float."}},"required":["credits","credits_exact"],"additionalProperties":false}},"additionalProperties":false}},{"name":"higgsfield.estimate_video_cost","title":"Estimate Video Cost","description":"Estimate video generation credit cost without submitting a job. HTTPS image references are fetched, uploaded, and confirmed in your Higgsfield media library; repeated calls can create new uploads. Requires write access. Takes the same `params` object as generate_video: `params.model` is required; `prompt` and `duration` may be omitted (model defaults apply). For a Genjutsu recreation, preserve supplied reference images with role image and the confirmed driving/source video with role video in params.medias. Copying actions or camera movement uses hf_mult_motion_control; replacing a subject uses hf_mult_replace_object. A video-only price quote does not establish that all inputs for the requested recreation are ready. For custom follow-ups to a Genjutsu catalog video, resolve get_preset_instructions({preset:\"genjutsu\"}) before preflight; the current request determines the model, not the catalog recipe. Price-only requests may omit reference images and must respect any no-upload instruction. Preparing a complete request requires the supplied images and one confirmed video; ask about conflicting upload instructions. Read input_check for missing roles and reuse prepared_params with resolved UUIDs. A successful quote never validates generation readiness. This tool is part of plugin `Higgsfield`.","inputSchema":{"type":"object","properties":{"params":{"type":"object","properties":{"model":{"type":"string","description":"Model ID from the model catalog (required)."},"prompt":{"description":"Text description of what to generate.","type":"string"},"count":{"default":1,"description":"Number of results (1-4). Ignored with use_unlim: an unlim request is always one generation — count is capped to 1 and the cap comes back in adjustments. Send separate calls for more.","type":"integer","minimum":1,"maximum":4},"aspect_ratio":{"description":"Output aspect ratio: 'auto' or positive width:height, for example '1:1', '9:16', or '16:9'. Omit for the selected model's default. Use models_get to inspect that model's supported values; the server coerces unsupported well-formed ratios when a safe model fallback exists.","type":"string","pattern":"^(?:auto|[1-9]\\d*:[1-9]\\d*)$"},"folder_id":{"description":"Destination folder for this conversation. Use default_folder_id from create_project, or folder_id from create_folder when requested. Reuse on every generation and batch item in this conversation; never invent an ID or share a destination across chats. Omit by default for generation without a project. Before the first generation without a destination, call get_preferences: create a project only when auto_create_project is true or explicitly requested. Explicit existing destinations and requests to work without a project take priority; never change the saved preference for a one-off request.","type":"string","format":"uuid","pattern":"^([0-9a-fA-F]{8}-[0-9a-fA-F]{4}-[1-8][0-9a-fA-F]{3}-[89abAB][0-9a-fA-F]{3}-[0-9a-fA-F]{12}|00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000|ffffffff-ffff-ffff-ffff-ffffffffffff)$"},"medias":{"description":"Reference media inputs.","type":"array","items":{"type":"object","properties":{"value":{"type":"string","description":"Uploaded media UUID from media_upload_and_confirm, completed generation job UUID, or authorized HTTPS image URL. HTTPS image URLs are imported and confirmed automatically."},"role":{"type":"string","enum":["image","start_image","end_image","video","audio","ref_element"],"description":"Canonical reference role. Allowed: 'image' — Generic reference image (style, composition, subject). | 'start_image' — First frame of the output video. | 'end_image' — Last frame of the output video. | 'video' — Reference video clip. | 'audio' — Reference audio clip. | 'ref_element' — Named element to preserve across frames (product, character). The selected model may support only a subset; use models_get to inspect it. The server maps canonical roles to model-specific backend media keys when needed."}},"required":["value","role"]}},"use_unlim":{"description":"Which balance pays for this generation: the caller's free-trial unlimited generations (true) or their credits (false). OMIT IT to let the server decide — if they hold an allowance that covers the model, the tool submits nothing and returns `unlim_choice` for the user to answer; call again with the same params plus this field. true also caps count to 1.","type":"boolean"},"use_free_gens":{"description":"Spend one of the user's free generations instead of credits. Higgsfield Genjutsu only (hf_mult_motion_control, hf_mult_replace_object) — any other model is rejected. Pass true only when the user asks to use their free generation; balance and models_list report how many they hold under free_gens. A free run covers 480p/720p, one output, up to 30s; anything outside that is refused rather than silently billed. true caps count to 1.","type":"boolean"},"duration":{"description":"Requested duration in whole seconds (minimum 1). Omit for the selected model's default. Use models_get for model-specific allowed durations or ranges; unsupported values are moved to the nearest safe value.","type":"integer","minimum":1,"maximum":9007199254740991}},"required":["model"],"additionalProperties":{}}},"required":["params"],"$schema":"https://json-schema.org/draft/2020-12/schema"},"annotations":{"readOnlyHint":false,"destructiveHint":false,"idempotentHint":false,"openWorldHint":true},"_meta":{"resource_name":"higgsfield.estimate_video_cost","_codex_apps":{"resource_uri":"/asdk_app_6a3293e129088191abf0875820e839da/link_6aa33369bcfc819186145531189aa64a/estimate_video_cost","contains_mcp_source":true},"connector_id":"asdk_app_6a3293e129088191abf0875820e839da","connector_name":"Higgsfield","connector_description":"Every image and video model","link_id":"link_6aa33369bcfc819186145531189aa64a","link_owner_profile":{"id":"user_3J9dbTRRRy9mgyFfLs0WNleobzi","name":"max gier","email":"maxgier2026@gmail.com","picture":"https://storage.googleapis.com/images.clerk.dev/oauth_google/img_3J9dbODiQXBDOdqN8MgplCHmEd5"}},"outputSchema":{"$schema":"https://json-schema.org/draft/2020-12/schema","type":"object","properties":{"input_check":{"description":"Genjutsu required-media presence only. A successful price quote does not validate media existence, duration or generation readiness.","type":"object","properties":{"required_media_present":{"type":"boolean"},"image_count":{"type":"integer","minimum":0,"maximum":9007199254740991},"video_count":{"type":"integer","minimum":0,"maximum":9007199254740991},"missing_roles":{"type":"array","items":{"type":"string","enum":["image","video"]}},"generation_validated":{"type":"boolean","const":false}},"required":["required_media_present","image_count","video_count","missing_roles","generation_validated"],"additionalProperties":false},"prepared_params":{"description":"Genjutsu request params with resolved media UUIDs and applied adjustments. May be incomplete; inspect input_check. Reuse instead of importing the same references again. No generation has been submitted or validated.","type":"object","propertyNames":{"type":"string"},"additionalProperties":{}},"cost":{"description":"Estimated generation cost. No job was submitted.","type":"object","properties":{"credits":{"type":"number","description":"Whole-credit cost (max(1, exact // 1) when exact > 0)."},"credits_exact":{"type":"number","description":"Exact credit cost as a float."}},"required":["credits","credits_exact"],"additionalProperties":false},"error":{"type":"string"},"adjustments":{"type":"object","propertyNames":{"type":"string"},"additionalProperties":{"type":"object","properties":{"requested":{"anyOf":[{"type":"string"},{"type":"number"},{"type":"boolean"}]},"used":{"anyOf":[{"type":"string"},{"type":"number"},{"type":"boolean"}]},"reason":{"type":"string"}},"required":["requested","used","reason"],"additionalProperties":false}}},"additionalProperties":false}},{"name":"higgsfield.website_db","title":"Website Database","description":"Inspect the website's database (D1 / SQLite), READ-ONLY. The website has ONE database — the live site's real data. Pick an operation: 'tables' (list tables); 'schema' (a table's columns — needs table); 'rows' (a page of rows — needs table; optional filters, order_by + order_dir, limit (default 50) + offset); 'query' (one read-only SELECT/WITH — needs sql). Writes and DDL are rejected. This tool is part of plugin `Higgsfield`.","inputSchema":{"type":"object","properties":{"website_id":{"type":"string","description":"The website's id (returned by create_website)."},"operation":{"type":"string","enum":["tables","schema","rows","query"],"description":"What to read: tables | schema | rows | query."},"table":{"description":"Table name. Required for 'schema' and 'rows'.","type":"string"},"filters":{"description":"'rows' filters, each 'col:op[:value]' (eq ne gt gte lt lte like is_null).","type":"array","items":{"type":"string"}},"order_by":{"type":"string"},"order_dir":{"type":"string","enum":["asc","desc"]},"limit":{"type":"integer","minimum":1,"maximum":9007199254740991},"offset":{"type":"integer","minimum":0,"maximum":9007199254740991},"sql":{"description":"A single read-only SELECT/WITH statement (operation 'query').","type":"string"}},"required":["website_id","operation"],"$schema":"https://json-schema.org/draft/2020-12/schema"},"annotations":{"readOnlyHint":true,"destructiveHint":false,"idempotentHint":true,"openWorldHint":false},"_meta":{"resource_name":"higgsfield.website_db","_codex_apps":{"resource_uri":"/asdk_app_6a3293e129088191abf0875820e839da/link_6aa33369bcfc819186145531189aa64a/website_db","contains_mcp_source":true},"connector_id":"asdk_app_6a3293e129088191abf0875820e839da","connector_name":"Higgsfield","connector_description":"Every image and video model","link_id":"link_6aa33369bcfc819186145531189aa64a","link_owner_profile":{"id":"user_3J9dbTRRRy9mgyFfLs0WNleobzi","name":"max gier","email":"maxgier2026@gmail.com","picture":"https://storage.googleapis.com/images.clerk.dev/oauth_google/img_3J9dbODiQXBDOdqN8MgplCHmEd5"}},"outputSchema":{"$schema":"https://json-schema.org/draft/2020-12/schema","type":"object","properties":{"result":{"description":"The read result (shape depends on operation).","type":"object","propertyNames":{"type":"string"},"additionalProperties":{}},"error":{"type":"string"}},"additionalProperties":false}},{"name":"higgsfield.execute_preset","title":"Execute Preset","description":"Request execution of one published preset from the Viral or Marketing Studio gallery. A bare preset slash command or a request to open, preview, or browse a preset only opens its widget. For supplied attachments, use input_schema from get_preset_instructions to map and upload the relevant files before opening any widget. Call get_presets exactly once with source, preset_id and initial_inputs in the exact schema fields. Do not call get_presets just to inspect the schema. Leave omitted settings to schema defaults; never reopen the detail merely to repeat default selections. Never assume one photo satisfies all requirements or guess ambiguous slot assignments. Leave missing fields in the prefilled widget for the user. Stop after opening the detail and let the user interact with it. Do not call execute_preset unless the user explicitly asks to generate, or submits with Recreate in the widget. Check execution.readiness for the supplied inputs before execution; collect missing or invalid fields instead of submitting. execution.available indicates capability, not permission; optional inputs and built-in media do not authorize generation. Readiness checks input structure, not media ownership or upload confirmation; use only confirmed media IDs. If the widget reports submitted job IDs, display and wait for those jobs without executing again. Check execution.available in the preset detail before calling. Unavailable execution returns an error without submitting a job. Use get_presets to obtain the published preset_id and source; do not invent either value. A successful submission returns final job_ids; a preset may produce multiple outputs. Use job_display for one job, jobs_wait and show_generation_by_ids for multiple jobs. Preset-specific inputs are a free-form object; their requirements are defined by the selected preset, not by this tool schema. This tool is part of plugin `Higgsfield`.","inputSchema":{"type":"object","properties":{"use_free_gens":{"description":"Use the one Viral attempt shared across all Viral presets and the website. Only source=viral, at 720p or lower. Higher resolutions and exhausted attempts reject without charging credits; omit for a paid run.","type":"boolean"},"source":{"type":"string","enum":["viral","marketing_studio","genjutsu"],"description":"Published gallery source. Genjutsu also accepts legacy marketing_studio."},"preset_id":{"type":"string","minLength":1,"maxLength":120,"description":"Published preset ID returned by get_presets; its catalog slug or exact name is also accepted."},"inputs":{"type":"object","propertyNames":{"type":"string"},"additionalProperties":{},"description":"Free-form inputs for the selected preset; use its execution.input_schema when available."}},"required":["source","preset_id","inputs"],"$schema":"https://json-schema.org/draft/2020-12/schema","additionalProperties":false},"annotations":{"readOnlyHint":false,"destructiveHint":false,"idempotentHint":false,"openWorldHint":true},"_meta":{"ui":{"visibility":["model","app"]},"resource_name":"higgsfield.execute_preset","_codex_apps":{"resource_uri":"/asdk_app_6a3293e129088191abf0875820e839da/link_6aa33369bcfc819186145531189aa64a/execute_preset","contains_mcp_source":true},"connector_id":"asdk_app_6a3293e129088191abf0875820e839da","connector_name":"Higgsfield","connector_description":"Every image and video model","link_id":"link_6aa33369bcfc819186145531189aa64a","link_owner_profile":{"id":"user_3J9dbTRRRy9mgyFfLs0WNleobzi","name":"max gier","email":"maxgier2026@gmail.com","picture":"https://storage.googleapis.com/images.clerk.dev/oauth_google/img_3J9dbODiQXBDOdqN8MgplCHmEd5"}},"outputSchema":{"$schema":"https://json-schema.org/draft/2020-12/schema","type":"object","properties":{"error_code":{"type":"string"},"source":{"type":"string","enum":["viral","marketing_studio"]},"preset_id":{"type":"string"},"error":{"type":"string"},"job_ids":{"description":"Final output jobs from the preset workflow; may contain multiple IDs. Intermediate workflow steps are not outputs.","type":"array","items":{"type":"string"}},"status":{"type":"string"}},"required":["source","preset_id"],"additionalProperties":false}},{"name":"higgsfield.ads_studio_card","title":"Ads Studio Card","description":"What the Ads Studio card shows: brands, one brand, products or one product. Used by the card. This tool is part of plugin `Higgsfield`.","inputSchema":{"type":"object","properties":{"kind":{"type":"string","enum":["brands","brand","products","product"]},"brand_id":{"type":"string","format":"uuid","pattern":"^([0-9a-fA-F]{8}-[0-9a-fA-F]{4}-[1-8][0-9a-fA-F]{3}-[89abAB][0-9a-fA-F]{3}-[0-9a-fA-F]{12}|00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000|ffffffff-ffff-ffff-ffff-ffffffffffff)$"},"product_id":{"type":"string","format":"uuid","pattern":"^([0-9a-fA-F]{8}-[0-9a-fA-F]{4}-[1-8][0-9a-fA-F]{3}-[89abAB][0-9a-fA-F]{3}-[0-9a-fA-F]{12}|00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000|ffffffff-ffff-ffff-ffff-ffffffffffff)$"},"product_ids":{"maxItems":10,"type":"array","items":{"type":"string","format":"uuid","pattern":"^([0-9a-fA-F]{8}-[0-9a-fA-F]{4}-[1-8][0-9a-fA-F]{3}-[89abAB][0-9a-fA-F]{3}-[0-9a-fA-F]{12}|00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000|ffffffff-ffff-ffff-ffff-ffffffffffff)$"}},"include_unpicked":{"type":"boolean"},"include_products":{"type":"boolean"},"cursor":{"type":"string"}},"required":["kind"],"$schema":"https://json-schema.org/draft/2020-12/schema"},"annotations":{"readOnlyHint":true,"destructiveHint":false,"idempotentHint":true,"openWorldHint":false},"_meta":{"ui":{"visibility":["app"]},"resource_name":"higgsfield.ads_studio_card","_codex_apps":{"resource_uri":"/asdk_app_6a3293e129088191abf0875820e839da/link_6aa33369bcfc819186145531189aa64a/ads_studio_card","contains_mcp_source":true},"connector_id":"asdk_app_6a3293e129088191abf0875820e839da","connector_name":"Higgsfield","connector_description":"Every image and video model","link_id":"link_6aa33369bcfc819186145531189aa64a","link_owner_profile":{"id":"user_3J9dbTRRRy9mgyFfLs0WNleobzi","name":"max gier","email":"maxgier2026@gmail.com","picture":"https://storage.googleapis.com/images.clerk.dev/oauth_google/img_3J9dbODiQXBDOdqN8MgplCHmEd5"}},"outputSchema":{"$schema":"https://json-schema.org/draft/2020-12/schema","type":"object","properties":{"kind":{"type":"string"},"brands":{"type":"array","items":{"type":"object","propertyNames":{"type":"string"},"additionalProperties":{}}},"brand":{"type":"object","propertyNames":{"type":"string"},"additionalProperties":{}},"brand_id":{"type":"string"},"brand_name":{"type":"string"},"products":{"type":"array","items":{"type":"object","propertyNames":{"type":"string"},"additionalProperties":{}}},"product":{"type":"object","propertyNames":{"type":"string"},"additionalProperties":{}},"next_cursor":{"type":"string"},"total":{"type":"number"},"error":{"type":"string"},"error_code":{"type":"string"},"credits_needed":{"description":"Credits required for the refused request.","type":"number"},"credits_short":{"description":"Credits missing for the refused request.","type":"number"},"credits_have":{"description":"Credits available when the request was refused.","type":"number"},"plan":{"description":"The account's current plan when access was refused.","type":"string"},"allowed_plans":{"description":"Plans supported by Ads Studio.","type":"array","items":{"type":"string"}},"limit":{"description":"The concurrent-generation limit when the queue was full.","type":"number"},"queued":{"description":"The queued generation count when the queue was full.","type":"number"}},"additionalProperties":false}},{"name":"higgsfield.home_usecases","title":"Home use cases","description":"Load the home page's use-case cards, prompts, and reference media. This tool is part of plugin `Higgsfield`.","inputSchema":{"type":"object","properties":{},"$schema":"https://json-schema.org/draft/2020-12/schema"},"annotations":{"readOnlyHint":true,"destructiveHint":false,"idempotentHint":true,"openWorldHint":true},"_meta":{"ui":{"visibility":["app"]},"resource_name":"higgsfield.home_usecases","_codex_apps":{"resource_uri":"/asdk_app_6a3293e129088191abf0875820e839da/link_6aa33369bcfc819186145531189aa64a/home_usecases","contains_mcp_source":true},"connector_id":"asdk_app_6a3293e129088191abf0875820e839da","connector_name":"Higgsfield","connector_description":"Every image and video model","link_id":"link_6aa33369bcfc819186145531189aa64a","link_owner_profile":{"id":"user_3J9dbTRRRy9mgyFfLs0WNleobzi","name":"max gier","email":"maxgier2026@gmail.com","picture":"https://storage.googleapis.com/images.clerk.dev/oauth_google/img_3J9dbODiQXBDOdqN8MgplCHmEd5"}}},{"name":"higgsfield.marketing_delete_brand_kit","title":"Delete Brand Kit","description":"Delete an existing brand kit by id. This permanently removes that brand kit from Marketing Studio. This tool is part of plugin `Higgsfield`.","inputSchema":{"type":"object","properties":{"brand_kit_id":{"type":"string","format":"uuid","pattern":"^([0-9a-fA-F]{8}-[0-9a-fA-F]{4}-[1-8][0-9a-fA-F]{3}-[89abAB][0-9a-fA-F]{3}-[0-9a-fA-F]{12}|00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000|ffffffff-ffff-ffff-ffff-ffffffffffff)$","description":"Brand kit ID to delete."}},"required":["brand_kit_id"],"$schema":"https://json-schema.org/draft/2020-12/schema"},"annotations":{"readOnlyHint":false,"destructiveHint":true,"idempotentHint":false,"openWorldHint":false},"_meta":{"resource_name":"higgsfield.marketing_delete_brand_kit","_codex_apps":{"resource_uri":"/asdk_app_6a3293e129088191abf0875820e839da/link_6aa33369bcfc819186145531189aa64a/marketing_delete_brand_kit","contains_mcp_source":true},"connector_id":"asdk_app_6a3293e129088191abf0875820e839da","connector_name":"Higgsfield","connector_description":"Every image and video model","link_id":"link_6aa33369bcfc819186145531189aa64a","link_owner_profile":{"id":"user_3J9dbTRRRy9mgyFfLs0WNleobzi","name":"max gier","email":"maxgier2026@gmail.com","picture":"https://storage.googleapis.com/images.clerk.dev/oauth_google/img_3J9dbODiQXBDOdqN8MgplCHmEd5"}},"outputSchema":{"$schema":"https://json-schema.org/draft/2020-12/schema","type":"object","properties":{"item":{},"success":{"type":"boolean"},"note":{"type":"string"},"error":{"type":"string"}},"additionalProperties":false}},{"name":"higgsfield.list_folders","title":"List Folders","description":"List direct subfolders of a Higgsfield media project or an explicit parent_folder_id. Use a project_id from list_projects, create_project or the user. Search matches child names under that parent, not the entire tree. Returns folder_id values for subsequent generation destinations and the actual project workspace even for an empty page. Does not list local directories or create folders. Continue with cursor and the same original workspace, project, parent and search; use has_more, not item count, to detect completion. This tool is part of plugin `Higgsfield`.","inputSchema":{"type":"object","properties":{"workspace_id":{"type":"string","format":"uuid","pattern":"^([0-9a-fA-F]{8}-[0-9a-fA-F]{4}-[1-8][0-9a-fA-F]{3}-[89abAB][0-9a-fA-F]{3}-[0-9a-fA-F]{12}|00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000|ffffffff-ffff-ffff-ffff-ffffffffffff)$","description":"Authenticated workspace context from workspace discovery. Keep unchanged when paging; accessible shared projects may belong to other workspaces."},"search":{"description":"Case-insensitive name search among direct children of the selected parent.","type":"string","maxLength":100},"size":{"description":"Page size, default 20; maximum 50.","type":"integer","minimum":1,"maximum":50},"cursor":{"description":"Opaque cursor from the previous response. Retain the original workspace and filters.","type":"string","maxLength":1024},"project_id":{"type":"string","format":"uuid","pattern":"^([0-9a-fA-F]{8}-[0-9a-fA-F]{4}-[1-8][0-9a-fA-F]{3}-[89abAB][0-9a-fA-F]{3}-[0-9a-fA-F]{12}|00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000|ffffffff-ffff-ffff-ffff-ffffffffffff)$"},"parent_folder_id":{"description":"List direct children of this folder; omit for direct children of the project root.","type":"string","format":"uuid","pattern":"^([0-9a-fA-F]{8}-[0-9a-fA-F]{4}-[1-8][0-9a-fA-F]{3}-[89abAB][0-9a-fA-F]{3}-[0-9a-fA-F]{12}|00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000|ffffffff-ffff-ffff-ffff-ffffffffffff)$"}},"required":["workspace_id","project_id"],"$schema":"https://json-schema.org/draft/2020-12/schema"},"annotations":{"readOnlyHint":true,"destructiveHint":false,"idempotentHint":true,"openWorldHint":false},"_meta":{"resource_name":"higgsfield.list_folders","_codex_apps":{"resource_uri":"/asdk_app_6a3293e129088191abf0875820e839da/link_6aa33369bcfc819186145531189aa64a/list_folders","contains_mcp_source":true},"connector_id":"asdk_app_6a3293e129088191abf0875820e839da","connector_name":"Higgsfield","connector_description":"Every image and video model","link_id":"link_6aa33369bcfc819186145531189aa64a","link_owner_profile":{"id":"user_3J9dbTRRRy9mgyFfLs0WNleobzi","name":"max gier","email":"maxgier2026@gmail.com","picture":"https://storage.googleapis.com/images.clerk.dev/oauth_google/img_3J9dbODiQXBDOdqN8MgplCHmEd5"}},"outputSchema":{"$schema":"https://json-schema.org/draft/2020-12/schema","type":"object","properties":{"workspace_id":{"type":"string","format":"uuid","pattern":"^([0-9a-fA-F]{8}-[0-9a-fA-F]{4}-[1-8][0-9a-fA-F]{3}-[89abAB][0-9a-fA-F]{3}-[0-9a-fA-F]{12}|00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000|ffffffff-ffff-ffff-ffff-ffffffffffff)$"},"has_more":{"type":"boolean"},"cursor":{"anyOf":[{"type":"string"},{"type":"null"}]},"error":{"type":"string"},"project_id":{"type":"string","format":"uuid","pattern":"^([0-9a-fA-F]{8}-[0-9a-fA-F]{4}-[1-8][0-9a-fA-F]{3}-[89abAB][0-9a-fA-F]{3}-[0-9a-fA-F]{12}|00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000|ffffffff-ffff-ffff-ffff-ffffffffffff)$"},"parent_folder_id":{"type":"string","format":"uuid","pattern":"^([0-9a-fA-F]{8}-[0-9a-fA-F]{4}-[1-8][0-9a-fA-F]{3}-[89abAB][0-9a-fA-F]{3}-[0-9a-fA-F]{12}|00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000|ffffffff-ffff-ffff-ffff-ffffffffffff)$"},"items":{"type":"array","items":{"type":"object","properties":{"folder_id":{"type":"string","format":"uuid","pattern":"^([0-9a-fA-F]{8}-[0-9a-fA-F]{4}-[1-8][0-9a-fA-F]{3}-[89abAB][0-9a-fA-F]{3}-[0-9a-fA-F]{12}|00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000|ffffffff-ffff-ffff-ffff-ffffffffffff)$"},"parent_folder_id":{"anyOf":[{"type":"string","format":"uuid","pattern":"^([0-9a-fA-F]{8}-[0-9a-fA-F]{4}-[1-8][0-9a-fA-F]{3}-[89abAB][0-9a-fA-F]{3}-[0-9a-fA-F]{12}|00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000|ffffffff-ffff-ffff-ffff-ffffffffffff)$"},{"type":"null"}]},"workspace_id":{"type":"string","format":"uuid","pattern":"^([0-9a-fA-F]{8}-[0-9a-fA-F]{4}-[1-8][0-9a-fA-F]{3}-[89abAB][0-9a-fA-F]{3}-[0-9a-fA-F]{12}|00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000|ffffffff-ffff-ffff-ffff-ffffffffffff)$"},"name":{"type":"string"}},"required":["folder_id","parent_folder_id","workspace_id","name"],"additionalProperties":false}}},"additionalProperties":false}},{"name":"higgsfield.scene_builder_3d_show_scene","title":"3D Jutsu: show scene","description":"Show a minimal interactive 3D Jutsu scene preview with orbit, pan, zoom, a basic animation timeline with play/pause and seeking, and a link to the website. Choose projectId with scene_builder_3d_list_projects, scene_builder_3d_create_project, or the user's explicit selection. Pass revisionAfter from a successful edit to show that exact result, or omit revision for the latest committed GLB. Wait for edits to settle with scene_builder_3d_get_operation before showing their result. This reads an existing export; it never starts Blender, edits the scene, or includes uncommitted collaborative changes. Call this when the user asks to see the scene. For a completed scene creation, edit, or import task, call it once at the scene review boundary after settlement and verification. Do not repeat an unchanged revision. Authorized generation/status calls may follow; feedback or a verified mismatch can reopen editing and lead to a newly verified revision. The widget is for the user to inspect; it does not give the agent visual evidence. Use scene_builder_3d_query_python and scene_builder_3d_get_artifact for the agent's visual verification. If the client cannot display widgets, provide the returned projectUrl. This tool is part of plugin `Higgsfield`.","inputSchema":{"type":"object","properties":{"projectId":{"type":"string","format":"uuid","pattern":"^([0-9a-fA-F]{8}-[0-9a-fA-F]{4}-[1-8][0-9a-fA-F]{3}-[89abAB][0-9a-fA-F]{3}-[0-9a-fA-F]{12}|00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000|ffffffff-ffff-ffff-ffff-ffffffffffff)$","description":"Project ID from scene_builder_3d_list_projects, scene_builder_3d_create_project, or the user's explicit selection. Required on every project-scoped tool."},"revision":{"description":"Committed revision to preview. Omit for the latest committed revision; use revisionAfter to show the exact result of an edit.","type":"integer","minimum":0,"maximum":9007199254740991}},"required":["projectId"],"$schema":"https://json-schema.org/draft/2020-12/schema","additionalProperties":false},"annotations":{"readOnlyHint":true,"destructiveHint":false,"idempotentHint":true,"openWorldHint":false},"_meta":{"ui/resourceUri":"ui://higgsfield/3d-scene-builder.html","ui":{"resourceUri":"ui://higgsfield/3d-scene-builder.html"},"resource_name":"higgsfield.scene_builder_3d_show_scene","_codex_apps":{"resource_uri":"/asdk_a